  "ingredients": [
    "1 (9 inch) pie crust pastry",
    "9 fresh peaches, peeled and halved",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "0.33333334326744 cup all-purpose flour",
    "4 tablespoons unsalted butter, cut into small pieces",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "1 pinch ground nutmeg, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C). Press pie crust into a 9-inch pie pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kejZt1LZu2PR9IWjG19t5wlCZNk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/282042-peach-crumble-pie-VAT-001-step-01-72740317828d494482ac1dc55fa3e4be.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282042/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine sugar, flour, butter, and salt in a bowl; mix with your fingers until it has a pea-sized, crumbly texture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C6y0GKrduTaJFccOm0C-UbKlqAA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/282042-peach-crumble-pie-VAT-002-step-02-ee7c5ed2dcb340ec93208e8aaa01bdec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282042/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle 1/3 of the mixture into pie crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XrJkc_qGGXgFt-Ldp0qkNrL9C7w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/282042-peach-crumble-pie-VAT-003-step-03-850e8743d13b41cb99a9972bddd3a729.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282042/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lay peach halves, flat-sides down, onto crumb mixture. Cut remaining peach halves into sections and place in between the halves to fill any spaces.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lNog64CG6W8vpC-v7v_wKMX1tH8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/282042-peach-crumble-pie-VAT-004-step-04-4dd10168f7d34feda3debfef17318a5f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282042/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle remaining crumble mixture on top and sprinkle with nutmeg.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/udI6JKgCoKTCUO7mmFUBFroyCMs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/282042-peach-crumble-pie-VAT-005-step-05-1b07c20b829a41e9bffe07eeb71fe886.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/282042/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 15 minutes. Reduce heat to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C) and continue to bake until golden brown, about 30 minutes more.",
